From 5b73ec6117fb71d384f15debb3207a2d558a930c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: redC0rvus <111829302+redC0rvus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:25:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 23/24] [general] perf: --latency_log=path writes a
 per-guest-frame input/vblank/VdSwap/kick/CP/Present timing CSV (dev)

One row per VdSwap: first GetState poll of user 0 and the first one that saw a
new button press, the last guest vblank before it, VdSwap, when the guest's ring
write pointer kicked the indirect buffer holding the swap packet, when the CP
executed the swap, and the first host Present showing that frame. Off (no-op)
unless the cvar is set.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
